00:11:27.038 --> 00:11:28.929
I co-founded a startup with Max.

00:11:28.929 --> 00:11:30.674
Sometimes we kind of
run into that problem.

00:11:30.674 --> 00:11:33.519
People say no, they already
invested in a similar company.

00:11:33.519 --> 00:11:36.192
- And do you view them
as a direct competitor?

00:11:36.192 --> 00:11:37.062
- No, that's the problem.

00:11:37.062 --> 00:11:38.199
Like on paper, they
see us as a competitor.

00:11:38.199 --> 00:11:39.454
But when you dive into it's not.

00:11:39.454 --> 00:11:41.441
- Well that's where you guys
just have to do a better job

00:11:41.441 --> 00:11:43.074
and educating people how it's different.

00:11:43.074 --> 00:11:44.093
- Gotcha.
- Thanks.

00:11:44.093 --> 00:11:45.468
